{"strongs": "H3072", "word": "צֶ֫דֶק", "translit": "ye.ho.vah tsid.qe.nu", "root": "צדק", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "rightness, righteousness", "definition": "צֶ֫דֶק noun masculine Isa 1:21 rightness, righteousness ; — ׳ צ Lev 19:36 + 87 t.; צִדְקִי Isa 41:10 + 8 t., etc.; — 1. what is right, just, normal; rightness, justness , of weights and measures, אֵיפָה , אֶבֶן שְׁלֵמָה וָצֶדֶק Deut 25:15 a perfect and a just weight, ephah ; ׳ מאֹזְנֵי צ ; ׳ אַבְנֵי צ , ׳ אֵיפַת צ , ׳ הִין צ , ׳ בַּת צ Lev 19:36 ( H ) Job 31:6 ; Ezek 45:10 ׳ מַעְגְּלֵי צ right paths Ps 23:3 ׳ זִבְחֵי צ right peace-offerings Deut 33:19 ; Ps 4:6 ; Ps 51:21 . 2. righteousness , in government: \\ \\ a. of judges, rulers, kings, ׳ שׁפט בצ Lev 19:15 ( H ); ׳ שׁפט צ Deut 1:16 ; Prov 31:9 ׳ משׁפט צ Deut 16:18 ׳ רדף צ v Deut 16:20 ׳ חוֺקֵק צ Prov 8:15 ׳ מלך לצ Isa 32:1 ׳ דבּר צ Ps 58:2 also Prov 25:5 ; Ps 94:15 ; Eccl 5:7 . \\ \\ b. of law, as מִשְׁפָּטִים Isa 58:2 ; Ps 119:7 ; Ps 119:62 ; Ps 119:75 ; Ps 119:106 ; Ps 119:160 ( ᵐ5 , but ᵑ0 מִשְׁפַּט ), v Ps 119:164 as עֵדוֺת v Ps 119:138 v Ps 119:144 as מִצְוֺר v Ps 119:172 . \\ \\ c. of Davidic king, Messiah Isa 11:4 ; Isa 11:5 ; Isa 16:5 ; Ps 45:5 , ׳ דין דצ Ps 72:2 . \\ \\ d. of Jerusalem, as seat of just government, עִיר הַצֶּדֶק Isa 1:26 city of righteousness ; ׳ נְוֵה צ Jer 31:23 ; Jer 50:7 (possibly these reflect an original god צֶדֶק , see מַלְכִּי צֶדֶק ); יָלִין בָּהּ ׳ צ Isa 1:21 righteousness used to lodge in her ; compare ׳ מְקוֺם הצ Eccl 3:16 the place of righteousness. \\ \\ e. of God's attribute as sovereign Job 36:3 , husband of Israel Hos 2:21 ׳ צ his personified agent Ps 85:11 ; Ps 85:12 ; Ps 85:14 , foundation of his throne Ps 89:15 = Ps 97:2 in his government Ps 9:9 ; Ps 65:6 ; Ps 96:13 = Ps 98:9 , promise Isa 45:19 , administration of justice Job 8:3 ; Jer 11:20 ; Ps 7:18 ; Ps 48:11 ; Ps 50:6 = Ps 97:6 , vindication of his people Ps 9:5 ; Ps 35:24 ; Ps 35:28 raising up Cyrus Isa 45:13 , calling his servant Isa 42:6 אֱלֹהֵי צִדְקִי Ps 4:2 God of my righteousness (who vindicates me); his ׳ צ is everlasting Ps 119:142 . 3. righteousness, justice , in a case or cause Job 6:29 ; Job 8:6 ; Job 29:14 ; Ps 35:27 ; Isa 59:4 God ׳ שׁפט כצ Ps 7:9 judges according to righteousness ; ׳ גמל כצ Ps 18:21 ׳ השׁיב כצ v Ps 18:25 ׳ שׁמע צ Ps 17:1 ׳ הוציא צ Ps 37:6 . 4. rightness , in speech, ׳ דבּר צ Ps 52:5 (opposed to שֶׁקֶר ); ׳ יַגִּיד צ Prov 12:17 כל אמרי פי ׳ בצ Prov 8:8 ׳ שִׂפְתֵי צ Prov 16:13 . 5. righteousness , as ethically right Job 35:2 ; Ps 17:15 ; Ps 45:8 ; Prov 1:3 ; Prov 2:9 ; Eccl 7:15 ; Jer 22:13 ; Ezek 3:20 ; Hos 10:12 (read ׳ פְּרִי צ , so ᵐ5 We Now ); עלמים ׳ צ Dan 9:24 ׳ עשׂה צ Isa 64:4 ; Ps 119:121 ׳ פעל צ Ps 15:2 ׳ למד צ Isa 26:6 ; Isa 26:10 ׳ בקּשׁ צ Zeph 2:3 ׳ רדף צ Isa 51:1 ׳ ידע צ v Isa 51:7 . 6. righteousness as vindicated, justification in controversy with enemies and troubles, deliverance, victory, prosperity: \\ \\ a. of God as covenant-keeping, in redemption, בִּימִין צִדְקִי Isa 41:10 , || יֵשַׁע Isa 45:8 ; Isa 51:5 , compare Isa 42:21 ׳ בשּׂר צ Ps 40:10 ׳ אִמְרַת צ Ps 119:123 . \\ \\ b. in name יהוה צִדְקֵנוּ , of Messianic king (vindicating people's cause and giving victory) Jer 23:6 of city Jer 33:16 . \\ \\ c. of people as enjoying ׳ צ of salvation, || יְשׁוּעָה Isa 62:1 || כָּבוֺד Isa 58:8 ; Isa 62:2 ׳ כהנים יִלְבְּשׁוּ צ Ps 132:9 ׳ שַׁעֲרֵי צ Ps 118:19 ׳ אֵילֵי הצ Isa 61:3 . \\ \\ d. of Cyrus, יִקְרָאֵהוּ לְרַגְלוֺ ׳ צ Isa 41:2 (who) in victory calleth him at every step ( Che Hpt on whose steps attends victory , so Di Du ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6941')\">BDB6941</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6664')\">H6664</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3072')\">H3072</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6940')\">BDB6940</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6942')\">BDB6942</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>צֶ֫דֶק</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 1:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,21)\">Isa 1:21</ref></sup> <highlightword>rightness, righteousness</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:36\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,36)\">Lev 19:36</ref> + 87 t.; <bdbheb>צִדְקִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,10)\">Isa 41:10</ref> + 8 t., etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>what is right, just, normal; rightness, justness</highlight>, of weights and measures, <bdbheb>אֵיפָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אֶבֶן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שְׁלֵמָה וָצֶדֶק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 25:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,25,15)\">Deut 25:15</ref> <highlight>a perfect and a just weight, ephah</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מאֹזְנֵי צ</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַבְנֵי צ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵיפַת צ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הִין צ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּת צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:36\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,36)\">Lev 19:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Job 31:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,6)\">Job 31:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,10)\">Ezek 45:10</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַעְגְּלֵי צ</bdbheb> <highlight>right paths</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 23:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,23,3)\">Ps 23:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>זִבְחֵי צ</bdbheb> <highlight>right peace-offerings</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,19)\">Deut 33:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 4:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,4,6)\">Ps 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,21)\">Ps 51:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>righteousness</highlight>, in government: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of judges, rulers, kings, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁפט בצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,15)\">Lev 19:15</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁפט צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,16)\">Deut 1:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,9)\">Prov 31:9</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>משׁפט צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 16:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,18)\">Deut 16:18</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רדף צ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Deut 16:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,16,20)\">Deut 16:20</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חוֺקֵק צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,15)\">Prov 8:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מלך לצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 32:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,1)\">Isa 32:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דבּר צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 58:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,2)\">Ps 58:2</ref> also <ref ref=\"Prov 25:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,5)\">Prov 25:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 94:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,15)\">Ps 94:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,7)\">Eccl 5:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of law, as <bdbheb>מִשְׁפָּטִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 58:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,2)\">Isa 58:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,7)\">Ps 119:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:62\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"62\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"62\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,62)\">Ps 119:62</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:75\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"75\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"75\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,75)\">Ps 119:75</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:106\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"106\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"106\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,106)\">Ps 119:106</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:160\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"160\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"160\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,160)\">Ps 119:160</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>מִשְׁפַּט</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Ps 119:164\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"164\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"164\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,164)\">Ps 119:164</ref> as <bdbheb>עֵדוֺת</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 119:138\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"138\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"138\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,138)\">Ps 119:138</ref> v<ref ref=\"Ps 119:144\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"144\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"144\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,144)\">Ps 119:144</ref> as <bdbheb>מִצְוֺר</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 119:172\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"172\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"172\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,172)\">Ps 119:172</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of Davidic king, Messiah <ref ref=\"Isa 11:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,4)\">Isa 11:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 11:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,5)\">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 16:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,5)\">Isa 16:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 45:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,5)\">Ps 45:5</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דין דצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 72:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"72\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"72\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,72,2)\">Ps 72:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> of Jerusalem, as seat of just government, <bdbheb>עִיר הַצֶּדֶק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:26\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,26)\">Isa 1:26</ref> <highlight>city of righteousness</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נְוֵה צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 31:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,23)\">Jer 31:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,7)\">Jer 50:7</ref> (possibly these reflect an original god <bdbheb>צֶדֶק</bdbheb>, see <bdbheb>מַלְכִּי צֶדֶק</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>יָלִין בָּהּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,21)\">Isa 1:21</ref> <highlight>righteousness used to lodge in her</highlight>; compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְקוֺם הצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:16\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,16)\">Eccl 3:16</ref> <highlight>the place of righteousness.</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> of God's attribute as sovereign <ref ref=\"Job 36:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,3)\">Job 36:3</ref>, husband of Israel <ref ref=\"Hos 2:21\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,21)\">Hos 2:21</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> his personified agent <ref ref=\"Ps 85:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,11)\">Ps 85:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 85:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,12)\">Ps 85:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 85:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,14)\">Ps 85:14</ref>, foundation of his throne <ref ref=\"Ps 89:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,15)\">Ps 89:15</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 97:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"97\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"97\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,97,2)\">Ps 97:2</ref> in his government <ref ref=\"Ps 9:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,9,9)\">Ps 9:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 65:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,65,6)\">Ps 65:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 96:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"96\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"96\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,96,13)\">Ps 96:13</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 98:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"98\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"98\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,98,9)\">Ps 98:9</ref>, promise <ref ref=\"Isa 45:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,19)\">Isa 45:19</ref>, administration of justice <ref ref=\"Job 8:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,3)\">Job 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 11:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,20)\">Jer 11:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 7:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,7,18)\">Ps 7:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 48:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,48,11)\">Ps 48:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,6)\">Ps 50:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 97:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"97\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"97\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,97,6)\">Ps 97:6</ref>, vindication of his people <ref ref=\"Ps 9:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,9,5)\">Ps 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,24)\">Ps 35:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,28)\">Ps 35:28</ref> raising up Cyrus <ref ref=\"Isa 45:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,13)\">Isa 45:13</ref>, calling his servant <ref ref=\"Isa 42:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,6)\">Isa 42:6</ref> <bdbheb>אֱלֹהֵי צִדְקִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 4:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,4,2)\">Ps 4:2</ref> God <highlight>of my righteousness</highlight> (who vindicates me); his <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> is everlasting <ref ref=\"Ps 119:142\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"142\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"142\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,142)\">Ps 119:142</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>righteousness, justice</highlight>, in a case or cause <ref ref=\"Job 6:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,29)\">Job 6:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 8:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,6)\">Job 8:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 29:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,14)\">Job 29:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:27\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,27)\">Ps 35:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 59:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,4)\">Isa 59:4</ref> God <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁפט כצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 7:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,7,9)\">Ps 7:9</ref> <highlight>judges according to righteousness</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גמל כצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 18:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,21)\">Ps 18:21</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>השׁיב כצ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 18:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,25)\">Ps 18:25</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁמע צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 17:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,1)\">Ps 17:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הוציא צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 37:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,6)\">Ps 37:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>rightness</highlight>, in speech, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דבּר צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 52:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,5)\">Ps 52:5</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>שֶׁקֶר</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יַגִּיד צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 12:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,17)\">Prov 12:17</ref> <bdbheb>כל אמרי פי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,8)\">Prov 8:8</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שִׂפְתֵי צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,13)\">Prov 16:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>righteousness</highlight>, as ethically right <ref ref=\"Job 35:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,2)\">Job 35:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 17:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,15)\">Ps 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 45:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,8)\">Ps 45:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 1:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,3)\">Prov 1:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 2:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,9)\">Prov 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:15\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,15)\">Eccl 7:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 22:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,13)\">Jer 22:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,20)\">Ezek 3:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 10:12\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,12)\">Hos 10:12</ref> (read <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פְּרִי צ</bdbheb>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>); <bdbheb>עלמים</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 9:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,24)\">Dan 9:24</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עשׂה צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 64:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,64,4)\">Isa 64:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:121\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"121\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"121\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,121)\">Ps 119:121</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פעל צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 15:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,15,2)\">Ps 15:2</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>למד צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,6)\">Isa 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 26:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,10)\">Isa 26:10</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בקּשׁ צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:3\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,3)\">Zeph 2:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רדף צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 51:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,1)\">Isa 51:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ידע צ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Isa 51:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,7)\">Isa 51:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>righteousness</highlight> as vindicated, <highlight>justification</highlight> in controversy with enemies and troubles, <highlight>deliverance, victory, prosperity:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of God as covenant-keeping, in redemption, <bdbheb>בִּימִין</bdbheb> <bdbheb>צִדְקִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,10)\">Isa 41:10</ref>, || <bdbheb>יֵשַׁע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,8)\">Isa 45:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 51:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,5)\">Isa 51:5</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 42:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,21)\">Isa 42:21</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בשּׂר צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 40:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,10)\">Ps 40:10</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִמְרַת צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:123\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"123\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"123\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,123)\">Ps 119:123</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> in name <bdbheb>יהוה צִדְקֵנוּ</bdbheb>, of Messianic king (vindicating people's cause and giving victory) <ref ref=\"Jer 23:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,6)\">Jer 23:6</ref> of city <ref ref=\"Jer 33:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,16)\">Jer 33:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of people as enjoying <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> of salvation, || <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 62:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,62,1)\">Isa 62:1</ref> || <bdbheb>כָּבוֺד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 58:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,8)\">Isa 58:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 62:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,62,2)\">Isa 62:2</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כהנים יִלְבְּשׁוּ צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 132:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,9)\">Ps 132:9</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׁעֲרֵי צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 118:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,19)\">Ps 118:19</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵילֵי הצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 61:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,3)\">Isa 61:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> of Cyrus, <bdbheb>יִקְרָאֵהוּ לְרַגְלוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,2)\">Isa 41:2</ref> (who) <highlight>in victory calleth him at every step</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che<sup>Hpt</sup></lookup> <highlight>on whose steps attends victory</highlight>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 1:21", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Lev 19:36", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 19, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "Isa 41:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Deut 25:15", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 25, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Job 31:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 31, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 45:10", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 45, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ps 23:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Deut 33:19", "book": "DEU", "chapter":